  "title": "Beatles painting Images Of A Woman sells at auction for $1.74 million | 2024",
  "date": "2024-02-01",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>A painting by The Beatles titled ‘Images Of A Woman’ has sold at auction for $1.74 million. <span id=\"more-119647\"></span></p><p>The painting was sold at Christie’s in New York on 1 February 2024, for far more than the estimated $400,000–600,000.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-12402\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\" data-attachment-id=\"12402\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1600,1083\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles’ painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01-960x650.jpg\" src=\"/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01-960x650.jpg\" alt=\"The Beatles’ painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" width=\"800\" height=\"542\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-12402\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01-960x650.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01-580x393.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01-200x135.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01-768x520.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01-1536x1040.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p><p>‘Images Of A Woman’ is the only known painting by all four members of The Beatles. The oil and watercolour artwork was created by The Beatles in June and July 1966, while on tour in Tokyo. Unable to leave their suite at the Hilton hotel for three nights due to security reasons, they collaborated on the painting.</p><p>Each Beatle painted parts of the 30″x40″ paper, working by the light of a lamp in the centre. The lamp was removed when the painting was complete, and The Beatles signed the empty space next to their contributions.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/2024/02/01/beatles-painting-images-of-a-woman-sells-auction-christies/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-119647 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_08/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTU3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE1NyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"157\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_08-200x157.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_08-200x157.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_08-580x456.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_08-960x755.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_08-768x604.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_08-1536x1208.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_08.jpg 1600w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"12409\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_08/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_08.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1600,1258\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_08-960x755.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_07/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMzIiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTMyIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"132\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_07-132x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_07-132x200.jpg 132w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_07.jpg 358w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 132px) 100vw, 132px\" data-attachment-id=\"12408\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_07/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_07.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"358,541\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_07.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_06/\"><img data-lazylo