 https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_05-396x580.jpg 396w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_05-656x960.jpg 656w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_05-768x1124.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_05.jpg 1013w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 137px) 100vw, 137px\" data-attachment-id=\"12406\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_05/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_05.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1013,1483\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_05-656x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_04/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMjciIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTI3IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"127\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_04-127x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_04-127x200.jpg 127w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_04-369x580.jpg 369w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_04-610x960.jpg 610w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_04-768x1208.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_04-976x1536.jpg 976w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_04.jpg 1017w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 127px) 100vw, 127px\" data-attachment-id=\"12405\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1017,1600\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_04-610x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTU3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE1NyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"157\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03-200x157.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03-200x157.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03-580x455.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03-960x753.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03-768x602.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03.jpg 1194w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"12404\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1194,936\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03-960x753.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>The paper and paints were provided by the Japanese promoter, Tats Nagashima, who suggested that the completed painting be auctioned for charity. It was subsequently bought by a cinema manager and local fan club president Tetsusaburo Shimoyama.</p><p>In <a href=\"/2012/09/14/beatles-painting-images-of-a-woman-sells-auction-155250/\">September 2012</a> it was put up for sale again through Philip Weiss Auctions in New York. The painting had a pre-auction estimate of $80,000 to $120,000, but sold for $155,250 including the buyer’s premium.</p><p>The <a href=\"https://www.christies.com/en/lot/lot-6467442\">2024 auction</a> took place at Christie’s at 20 Rockefeller Center, New York City. The buyer’s premium was $416,240, taking the total cost of ‘Images Of A Woman’ up to $2,160,240.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-12403\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iNTY3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDU2NyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"12403\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1600,1134\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-960x680.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-960x680.jpg\" alt=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" width=\"800\" height=\"567\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-12403\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-960x680.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-580x411.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-200x142.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-768x544.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-1536x1089.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02.jpg 1600w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p>\n<!--[googlesitekit-end-of-content]--><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 21 February 2024</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>1990: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1990/02/01/paul-mccartney-live-the-palace-auburn-hills/\">Paul McCartney live: The Palace, Auburn Hills</a></li><li>1979: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1979/02/01/mixing-goodnight-tonight-daytime-nighttime-suffering-wings-3/\">Mixing: Goodnight Tonight, Daytime Nighttime Suffering by Wings</a></li><li>1972: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1972/02/01/recording-give-ireland-back-to-the-irish-wings/\">Recording: Give Ireland Back To The Irish by Wings</a></li><li>1971: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1971/02/01/recording-uncle-albert-admiral-halsey-paul-linda-mccartney-2/\">Recording: Uncle Albert/Admiral Halsey by Paul and Linda McCartney</a></li><li>1970: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1970/02/01/ringo-and-maureen-fly-to-new-york-from-los-angeles/\">Ringo and Maureen fly to New York from Los Angeles</a></li><li>1969